  "name": "Ripcord WF-3 risk-score",
  "description": "Deterministic Aave V3 liquidation-risk snapshot for any Base address, from the same audited pipeline that executed a real autonomous mainnet defense (on-chain evidence trail in the Ripcord repo). Returns raw verifiable figures -- wad health factor, 8-decimal base-USD aggregates, LT/LTV bps -- plus Ripcord's threshold-band booleans (warn <1.50, act <1.25, panic <1.10, no-debt). Nothing is hidden: the score formula is open source (45% HF distance, 20% buffer-to-liquidation, 15% HF velocity, 10% collateral volatility, 10% borrow-capacity utilization; src/risk/engine.ts) and any response can be scored locally with `tsx scripts/risk-score.ts --json response.json`. Liquidation price = oracle collateral price x (1 - 1/HF) from the returned figures.",
